# Purpose: exercise source -x and source -as helper command loading.
# Usage: cdpscript examples/test-source.txtar
# Inputs: examples/lib/wait-for-load.cdp and examples/lib/screenshot.cdp.
# Verification: local mechanics only; writes /tmp/source-test.png.

-- main.cdp --
log === Testing has-tab condition ===
[has-tab] log Has existing tab - skipping navigation
[!has-tab] log No existing tab - would navigate here

log === Testing source -x (trace) ===
source -x examples/lib/wait-for-load.cdp

log === Testing source -as (register command) ===
source -as take-shot examples/lib/screenshot.cdp
take-shot /tmp/source-test.png

log === All tests passed! ===
